  "notes": [
    "Same art style and rules as content/shop/shop-batch-01.json.",
    "Items with transparent: true (the Wasteland Luxe batch) already have transparent PNG sources; skip background removal for them. Items with transparent: false still have the plain cream background: remove it with a simple color-key on the flat background, treating the floor shadow the same way on every item. Then resize everything to 256 px and 768 px, convert to WebP at about 80% quality, upload both, and keep the masters in storage.",
    "Prices are in C$. clout is round(sqrt(price)); use the game's own Shop clout formula instead if it has one.",
    "template values starting with 'rigid:' are accessories that don't bend with the body. They can be made from Higgsfield 3D models (GLB) attached to the head, face, ears, neck or hand, so they can become wearable before clothing templates exist.",
    "wearable is false until the item's template works in both presentations; items stay hidden from the Shop until then.",
    "Style line 'wasteland-luxe' is a new tag for the distressed-luxury look; it sits under Luxury and Avant-garde."
  ],
